! ==================================================================================================
! Building-side load generator for ACWS LLM-guided transfer RL study
! Domain: S3
! Purpose: Generate weather-consistent hourly cooling loads from a Meteonorm EPW file.
! EnergyPlus: 24.2
! Notes:
!  - This is an equivalent whole-building load model using ZoneHVAC:IdealLoadsAirSystem.
!  - It is not intended to simulate plant energy use. Use its cooling-load output to replace S3_acws_load_profile.csv.
!  - The zone multiplier represents an equivalent conditioned floor area, not a detailed architectural model.
! ==================================================================================================

